OL,3,GNEWSAEight people arrested after fight
OL,4,Awith weapons
OL,5,
OL,6,FEight people have been arrested after
OL,7,Fpolice were called to a fight involving
OL,8,Fa group of men with weapons.
OL,10,FLeicestershire Police said armed
OL,11,Fofficers were deployed to Winstanley
OL,12,FDrive, in Braunstone, just after 17:00
OL,13,FBST on Thursday "in the interest of
OL,14,Fpublic and police safety".
OL,16,FNo serious injuries were reported and
OL,17,Fthe men - three aged 18, two aged 23,
OL,18,Ftwo aged 20 and one aged 21 - were
OL,19,Farrested on suspicion of affray.
OL,21,FThe force is appealing for anyone with
OL,22,Finformation or footage to come forward.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
